OL,4,BOsimhen keen on Man Utd move -         
OL,5,BSaturday's gossip                      
OL,6,GVictor Osimhen keen on move to         
OL,7,GManchester United, Aston Villa         
OL,8,Ginterested in Amad Diallo and Ivan     
OL,9,GToney a target for Crystal Palace,     
OL,10,Gplus more.                             
OL,12,FGalatasaray and Nigeria striker Victor 
OL,13,FOsimhen, 27, is willing to move to     
OL,14,FManchester United in a #100m January   
OL,15,Fdeal if they can match his current     
OL,16,Fsalary. (Sun)                          
